# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-GEZHQ`.
#
# The end-to-end shape TASK-EP3H1's gate run caught: a real dispatch through the
# daemon whose harness cannot authenticate. What the injection restores is not a
# credential — the credential is still pinned three ways — it is the machine's
# ability to make the stub too slow to be heard, which is what the loaded
# workspace run did to it. The probe then has no answer, an inconclusive probe
# does not reject, and the dispatch is admitted with a lease, a session file, a
# run record and a live worker process.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --test dispatch_preflight an_unusable_credential_leaves_no_lease_no_session_and_no_run
